                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1958–1960, Foreign Economic Policy, Volume IV. Please be
                    aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d7">Document 7</ref>, Page 13 (date
                            of correction: January 5, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4” of Document 1 has been corrected to “footnote
                        3”.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
